gm-method (_tickPhysicsLOD skips entities without _bodyDef; changeBodyType must synthesize one): _tickPhysicsLOD SKIPS any entity without a _bodyDef and rebuilds an existing one from its FROZEN _bodyDef.motionType -- so a body-type switch is a server-side NO-OP for entities that were placed without a physics body (no _bodyDef). Also: the build gate _bodyActive===false never fires for a never-had-a-body entity (undefined != false). Fix: changeBodyType must update-or-synthesize _bodyDef with the new motionType (fallback box from scale*0.5), set _bodyActive=false, clear active/sleeping/suspended sets, null _lodIds.